# Store and check out every file byte-for-byte, with no line-ending conversion.
#
# This tree's line endings are mixed on purpose-as-found: ScopeTypes.h is LF,
# ScopeReader.cpp is CRLF, and some files are mixed internally (see
# GPU_PORT_HANDOFF.md section 6). Git's default autocrlf on Windows would
# rewrite them on checkout, which would both churn the whole tree and change
# the bytes that scripted edits match against. A repository that exists to be
# a safety net must not edit the files it is protecting.
* -text
